1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:02,360
You know the most beautiful thing about us.

2
00:00:03,140 --> 00:00:05,100
It happened so unexpectedly.

3
00:00:06,220 --> 00:00:08,420
We never planned on falling in love,

4
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:11,420
and maybe that's why it feels so special.

5
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:13,300
No expectations.

6
00:00:14,340 --> 00:00:15,020
No timeline.

7
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:17,780
Just two hearts finding their way.

8
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:19,900
It's more than love.

9
00:00:20,740 --> 00:00:21,340
It's home.
